"Lind is an Artonan woman on Earth, partnered with Esh, whose presence she feels strongly."
"She wears her brown hair in three braids cuffed with wooden hoops."
"She wears a studded uniform and a sea-foam coat."
"She stays in a mirrored cube building at sea off Anesidora."
"She felt Alden's undirected pulse of authority as an authority greeting."
"Her full name is Lind-otta, of the otta family."
"During the Matadero attack she and Esh dropped among the fighters to finish the demon."
